ss a series of strange and colorful lands to collect the Crystal Stars, rescue the princess, and uncover the secret that lies behind the legendary door.", "summary": "A remake of the second game in the Paper Mario series, originally released for the Nintendo GameCube.\n\nTurn the page and join Mario and friends in an RPG adventure to discover the legendary treasure behind the ancient Thousand-Year Door. Will Mario complete his papery quest, or will he crumple under the pressure?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/paper-mario-the-thousand-year-door--1", "videos": [{"id": 97866, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "8Ume5pSIcKE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8Ume5pSIcKE", "title": "Paper Mario: The Thousand-Year Door - Nintendo Direct 9.14.2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8Ume5pSIcKE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 114451, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "1CSAQ8UxK64", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1CSAQ8UxK64", "title": "Paper Mario: The Thousand-Year Door \u2014 Launch Trailer \u2014 Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1CSAQ8UxK64/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 593, "name": "Paper Mario"}]}